    "title": "  [Bugfix][Frontend] Import parser plugins under the vllm.* namespace so their logs survive",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-04T03:59:55Z",
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/52026",
    "user": {
